sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Human as You
    participant Extension as Browser extension
    participant Server as Local AgentGraph server
    participant Connector as Owning connector
    participant Service as Source service
    participant Graph as Local graph
    actor Agent as Your agent

    rect rgb(232, 255, 246)
        Note over Human,Graph: Observe: attention triggers a targeted fetch
        Human->>Extension: Keep a supported page focused
        Extension->>Extension: Wait for observation threshold
        Extension->>Server: Report URL and observation ID
        Server->>Connector: Resolve and fetch resource
        Connector->>Service: Read through the source API
        Service-->>Connector: Resource content and metadata
        Connector->>Graph: Upsert entities, people, and edges
        Server->>Graph: Set observed_at and duration
    end

    rect rgb(255, 247, 214)
        Note over Agent,Graph: Fetch: the agent asks for missing or stale context
        Agent->>Server: fetch_entity_tool(platform, resource_id)
        Server->>Connector: Fetch the requested resource
        Connector->>Service: Read through the source API
        Service-->>Connector: Resource content and metadata
        Connector->>Graph: Upsert entities, people, and edges
        Note over Server,Graph: Direct fetch does not set observed_at
    end

    rect rgb(237, 244, 255)
        Note over Server,Graph: Refresh: configured connectors keep known context current
        Server->>Connector: Scheduled poll or ingest
        Connector->>Service: Read changes
        Connector->>Graph: Upsert changed context
        Note over Server,Graph: Polling and ingest do not set observed_at
    end
